category: Clusters|Media
description: >
  Implementation of the Audio Control Server Cluster.
  The user has to enable the Audio Control Server Cluster in the ZCL Advanced Platform (ZAP) tool in order to enable this functionality.
id: matter_audio_control
package: matter
label: Audio Control Server Cluster
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: "Apache 2.0"
provides:
  - name: matter_audio_control
source:
  - path: third_party/matter_sdk/src/app/clusters/audio-control-server/AudioControlCluster.cpp
  - path: third_party/matter_sdk/src/app/clusters/audio-control-server/CodegenIntegration.cpp
    unless: [matter_code_driven_dm]
include:
  - path: third_party/matter_sdk/src/app/clusters/audio-control-server
    file_list:
      - path: AudioControlCluster.h
      - path: AudioControlDelegate.h
      - path: CodegenIntegration.h
        unless: [matter_code_driven_dm]
template_contribution:
  - name: component_catalog
    value: matter_audio_control